results.description:
TRACX is the ultimate event app for athletes who push their limits at the world’s largest sports events. The app provides an overview of all the events we support worldwide. Athletes can easily find sports events, while fans can follow any athlete, anywhere, live. Ready? Set. Go!

Key features for athletes:

- View all event information;
- Receive the latest event updates;
- Share your live location with friends and family during the event;
- Check your performance on the leaderboards and compare your results with other athletes;
- Share your results and finish-selfie with others.

Key features for fans:

- Follow your friends, family, or other athletes during live events;
- Receive the latest event updates;
- Activate notifications to receive the latest updates from your favorite athlete.

Other features:
- Don’t miss anything with the LiveTracking feature. See exactly where your favourite athlete is, how many kilometers they have covered, how many kilometers remain, and what position they hold on the leaderboard;
- Create your own profile, which can be used for every TRACX event. Compare your results across different events and build your fanbase;
- Your timeline informs you of the latest developments surrounding your events. Discover which athletes you can follow, view countdowns of your upcoming events, and receive updates about your favourite athletes;
- Discover the event races and routes.

TRACX integrates with all timing systems, including MYLAPS, ChronoTrack, and RaceResults. We work with the best timers to provide the most accurate timing during events, so that we can give athletes and fans the best possible event experience.

